WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.900
Fidio yii ṣapejuwe deede ati irisi inawo pupa aiṣedeede.

2
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Ayẹwo owo sisan pupa deede jẹ nigbati ko si iyatọ gbogbogbo ninu imọlẹ ati awọ laarin awọn oju meji pẹlu awọn ifojusọna igun aarin.

3
00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:31.530
Paapaa irisi deede ti ifasilẹ inawo yoo, sibẹsibẹ, yatọ da lori bi o ṣe jinna ati ibiti ọmọ naa n wa.

4
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:42.010
O jẹ idanwo agbara ti nṣiṣe lọwọ nibiti o yẹ ki o gbe ẹgbẹ si ẹgbẹ ati sẹhin ati siwaju ni ati ni ayika ipari apa lati ọdọ alaisan.

5
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:51.350
Awọn ọmọde ati awọn ọmọde yoo tun gbe ọwọ ati oju wọn, ti o mu ki ifasilẹ yi pada bi o ti n wo lakoko idanwo naa.

6
00:00:51.910 --> 00:01:02.350
Ninu ọmọ dudu, ifasilẹ naa maa n wo biba pupọ, pẹlu ofeefee ati funfun ati paapaa buluu nigbakan bi awọ akọkọ.

7
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:14.970
Ni pataki, ni idanwo deede, ko yẹ ki o jẹ iyatọ gbogbogbo ninu imọlẹ ati awọ laarin awọn oju meji pẹlu awọn ifojusọna igun aarin.

8
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:23.850
Ifesisilẹ ajeji jẹ nigbati itarara, iyatọ gidi wa ninu imọlẹ ati awọ laarin awọn oju meji.

9
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:35.840
Iṣaro corneal ti o nipo, alemo dudu ti o wa laarin ifasilẹ ti oju kan tabi oju mejeeji, tabi ifasilẹ pupa ti ko si patapata.

10
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:56.330
Idanwo reflex ajeji le ṣe afihan wiwa cataract, retinoblastoma, aleebu corneal, squint, aṣiṣe ifasilẹ tabi awọn iṣoro abimọ gẹgẹbi coloboma.

11
00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.690
Gbogbo eyi nilo atunyẹwo siwaju nipasẹ alamọja.

12
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:10.900
Wo ifasilẹ yii ki o beere lọwọ ararẹ: Ṣe deede ni eyi tabi ajeji? Awọn idahun yoo tẹle lẹhinna.

13
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:45.840
O yẹ ki o ni oye ti o dara julọ ti kini ifasilẹ deede kan dabi, bakanna bi awọn ifasilẹ ajeji, ati ni anfani lati daba idi ti o ṣeeṣe julọ.
